---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Custom Cabinetry Services" description="Custom kitchen cabinets, bathroom vanities, built-ins, cabinet styles, colours, finishes, and installation in Mississauga.">
  <header class="page-hero"><div class="container"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Services</span></nav><p class="eyebrow">Custom cabinetry</p><h1>Made for your space, style, and everyday life.</h1><p class="lede">From custom kitchens and bathroom vanities to built-in storage, every project is planned for your home.</p></div></header>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="services-heading" class="sr-only">Our cabinetry services</h2>
      <div class="detail-grid">
        <article class="detail-card" id="kitchens"><p class="eyebrow">01 · Kitchens</p><h2>The kitchen you have always wanted.</h2><p>We design custom kitchens that make the most of your available space while reflecting your individual taste—whether you are renovating or designing for a new home.</p><ul><li>Upper and lower cabinetry</li><li>Islands and peninsulas</li><li>Pantry storage</li><li>Appliance surrounds</li><li>Drawer organizers</li><li>Glass display cabinets</li><li>Waste pull-outs</li><li>Range hood surrounds</li><li>Crown moulding</li><li>Soft-close doors</li></ul></article>
        <article class="detail-card" id="vanities"><p class="eyebrow">02 · Bathrooms</p><h2>Beautiful storage for your bathroom.</h2><p>A well-designed vanity can transform your bathroom while providing the storage you need every day. Choose from a wide range of configurations and finishes.</p><ul><li>Single-sink vanities</li><li>Double-sink vanities</li><li>Floating vanities</li><li>Freestanding vanities</li><li>Makeup stations</li><li>Linen towers</li><li>Drawer storage</li><li>Open shelving</li><li>Medicine cabinets</li><li>Integrated cabinetry</li></ul></article>
        <article class="detail-card" id="built-ins"><p class="eyebrow">03 · Built-ins</p><h2>Storage that looks like it belongs there.</h2><p>Custom built-ins make better use of your home’s available space while creating a polished, finished appearance suited to its architecture.</p><ul><li>Entertainment centres</li><li>Fireplace surrounds</li><li>Home offices</li><li>Libraries</li><li>Bars</li><li>Laundry rooms</li><li>Mudrooms</li><li>Closets</li><li>Entryways</li><li>Basement storage</li></ul></article>
        <article class="detail-card"><p class="eyebrow">04 · Details</p><h2>Finishes that make it yours.</h2><p>Compare door profiles, colours, wood tones, hardware, interior accessories, and decorative details with guidance from our experienced team.</p><ul><li>Shaker doors</li><li>Slim Shaker doors</li><li>Flat-panel doors</li><li>Raised panels</li><li>Glass inserts</li><li>Custom colours</li><li>Wood-look finishes</li><li>Two-tone schemes</li><li>Interior accessories</li><li>Hardware options</li></ul></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--ivory" aria-labelledby="styles-title"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">Cabinet styles</p><h2 id="styles-title">Find a look that fits your home.</h2></div><p>Your cabinetry plays a major role in defining the character of your kitchen or living space.</p></div><div class="style-grid"><article class="style-card"><h3>Modern</h3><p>Clean lines, simple profiles, neutral colours, and streamlined storage.</p></article><article class="style-card"><h3>Contemporary</h3><p>Current design with warm wood, painted finishes, and thoughtful contrast.</p></article><article class="style-card"><h3>Transitional</h3><p>Traditional detail balanced with modern simplicity and timeless colour.</p></article><article class="style-card"><h3>Traditional</h3><p>Warmth and elegance through detailed doors, trim, and classic finishes.</p></article><article class="style-card"><h3>European</h3><p>Efficient storage, sleek design, and refined architectural lines.</p></article></div></div></section>
  <CTA title="Let’s plan cabinetry for your home." text="Start with a free consultation and tell us what you would like to create." />
</BaseLayout>

